 Marvel Studios' Eternals will
be in theaters on November 5.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.783
Tickets are available now.

00:03:09.783 --> 00:03:10.750
 You should do it right now.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.450
And it's only in theaters--
only in theaters.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.250
 That's right.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.000
Only in theaters.

